type: software
title: NAKO Human Ribcage Statistical Shape Model
abstract: 'Population-level statistical shape model of the complete 24-rib human rib cage from 26,275
  whole-body MRI scans of the German National Cohort (NAKO): mean shape, principal modes, a demographics-to-shape
  generator, and the pipeline that produced them.'
